---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="UI/UX Prompt Packet" description="75 practical UI/UX prompts, workflows, and checklists to help you improve websites and apps.">
  <header class="page-intro packet-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Made by Digivated</p><h1>UI/UX Prompt Packet</h1>
    <p class="lede">A practical toolkit for improving websites and apps with AI. Choose a prompt, add your project details, and turn the suggestions into a clear next step.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/library?sample=1">Try 3 free prompts</a><a class="button purchase-link" href="https://mccovery.gumroad.com/l/ui-prompt-package">Buy the full packet</a></div>
    <p class="quiet">75 prompts · One-time purchase on Gumroad · No website account needed</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/access">Already purchased? Open your packet →</a>
  </header>
  <section class="packet-details" aria-label="What is included">
    <article><p class="eyebrow">Find a starting point</p><h2>75 practical prompts</h2><p>Review a screen, improve mobile layouts, or simplify a busy interface. Start with the task you need to solve.</p></article>
    <article><p class="eyebrow">Make it your own</p><h2>A prompt builder</h2><p>Add your audience, goals, and constraints to create a prompt suited to your project.</p></article>
    <article><p class="eyebrow">Follow through</p><h2>Guides &amp; checklists</h2><p>Eight workflows and eight review checklists help you apply suggestions and check the result.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="packet-steps" aria-labelledby="packet-steps-heading"><h2 id="packet-steps-heading">From prompt to progress</h2><ol><li><b>Choose a task</b><span>Open a free sample or browse the prompt library.</span></li><li><b>Add your context</b><span>Describe your screen, your audience, and what you want to improve.</span></li><li><b>Try and review</b><span>Paste into your AI tool, apply one useful suggestion, and check the result.</span></li></ol><a class="text-link" href="/start">Follow the getting-started guide →</a></section>
  <section class="packet-help" aria-labelledby="packet-access-heading"><h2 id="packet-access-heading">Already have the packet?</h2><p>Use the license key from your Gumroad receipt to unlock the full toolkit. <a href="/access">Open Packet Access →</a></p></section>
</Platform>
